@startuml
title DonMoa Facade Usage Example

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
  GroupBorderColor #CBD5E1
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #93C5FD
  FontColor #1E3A8A
}

participant "CheckoutCommandService" as Service
participant "StockOrderReservationClientFacade" as StockFacade
participant "DefaultStockClientFacade" as StockImpl
participant "Stock Service" as StockApi
participant "OrderCreateClientFacade" as OrderFacade
participant "DefaultOrderClientFacade" as OrderImpl
participant "Order Service" as OrderApi

== reserve() ==
Service -> StockFacade : reserveOrderStock(request)
StockFacade -> StockImpl : delegate
StockImpl -> StockApi : POST /internal/v1/stock/orders/reserve
StockApi --> StockImpl : ReserveOrderStockResponse
StockImpl --> Service : reserved stock result

note right of Service
서비스 입장에서는
HTTP 호출이 아니라
reserveOrderStock() 함수 호출처럼 사용한다.
end note

== submit() ==
Service -> OrderFacade : createOrder(request)
OrderFacade -> OrderImpl : delegate
OrderImpl -> OrderImpl : validate(request)
OrderImpl -> OrderApi : POST /internal/v1/orders
OrderApi --> OrderImpl : success / 409 / 5xx
OrderImpl --> Service : response or mapped exception

note right of StockImpl
실제 WebClient 호출, 응답 파싱,
예외 매핑은 facade 구현체에서 처리한다.
end note

note bottom
DX 메시지:
동기 통신을 facade 로 감싸면
서비스 코드는 "기능 호출"처럼 읽히고,
클라이언트 구현 변경 영향도도 줄어든다.

Checkout 같은 핵심 write path 에서도
동기 호출이 꼭 필요하지만,
서비스 코드가 지저분해지지 않는다.
end note

@enduml
